/// @notice P-256 raw ECDSA authenticator; actorId = keccak256(pub_key_x || pub_key_y).
///
/// @dev Data layout: r (32) || s (32) || pub_key_x (32) || pub_key_y (32) || pre_hash (1). The trailing
